# subtypes beside Dinosaur ("in addition to its other types", CR 205.1b), and its base power and toughness become 4/3 rather than staying 1/1
# (CR 613.4b). Bot1 casts it at instant speed during Bot2's turn 2, and it is a 1/1 again on turn 3.

